%%@ note: Solid arrows are request/response over HTTPS or local IPC. An edge label names the protocol or the purpose of the call.
%%@ note: Everything inside "HappyPix production platform" is code we deploy. Everything else is a customer site, a guest device, or a third-party provider.
flowchart TB
